  "content": "\n\n<p>英文：</p>\n<p>此附加组件将 <strong>TaCZ</strong> 物品添加到由 Berezka API 模组生成的战利品箱中。现在，在探索各类建筑时，您将发现包含 <strong>TaCZ</strong> 物品的独特战利品！</p>\n<p>🔹 <strong>支持的模组</strong></p>\n<ul>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/the-lost-city\" rel=\"nofollow\"><strong>The Lost City</strong></a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/abandoned-structures\" rel=\"nofollow\">Abandoned Structures</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/abandoned-structures-aviation\" rel=\"nofollow\">Abandoned Structures: Aviation</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/abandoned-structures-modern-houses\" rel=\"nofollow\">Abandoned Structures: Modern Houses</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/horror-structures-by-berezka\" rel=\"nofollow\">Horror Structures (by Berezka)</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/old-ruin-structures\" rel=\"nofollow\">Old Ruin Structures</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/berezkas-save-place\" rel=\"nofollow\">Berezka's Bunkers</a></li>\n</ul>\n<p>💬 加入 Discord 服务器以获取更新、反馈和建议：<br>👉 <a href=\"https://discord.gg/uAhSWWyqy3\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Discord</a></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>俄语：</p>\n<p>此附加组件将 <strong>TaCZ</strong> 物品添加到由 <strong>Berezka API</strong> 模组生成的箱子中。现在，在探索废弃城市及其他建筑时，您将能够找到包含 <strong>TaCZ</strong> 物品的独特战利品！</p>\n<p>🔹 <strong>支持的模组</strong></p>\n<ul>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/the-lost-city\" rel=\"nofollow\"><strong>The Lost City</strong></a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/abandoned-structures\" rel=\"nofollow\">Abandoned Structures</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/abandoned-structures-aviation\" rel=\"nofollow\">Abandoned Structures: Aviation</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/abandoned-structures-modern-houses\" rel=\"nofollow\">Abandoned Structures: Modern Houses</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/horror-structures-by-berezka\" rel=\"nofollow\">Horror Structures (by Berezka)</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/old-ruin-structures\" rel=\"nofollow\">Old Ruin Structures</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/berezkas-save-place\" rel=\"nofollow\">Berezka's Bunkers</a></li>\n</ul>\n<p>💬 加入我们的 Discord 服务器或 Telegram 频道，以跟踪更新、报告问题并提出建议：<br>👉 <a href=\"https://discord.gg/uAhSWWyqy3\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Discord</a></p>\n<p>👉&nbsp;<a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252ft.me%252fberezka_server\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Telegram</a></p>",
